  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAPACITY STRENGTHENING OF JUSTICE AND PEACE COMMISSION FOR EFFECTIVE IMPLEMENTATION OF GOVERNANCE PR</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project shall immensely encourage good governance project in Nigeria especially Idah Diocese. The provision of logistical facility will aid the successful implementation of governance work in Idah and Ibaji Local Government Areas. Ibaji Local Government Area is near to River Niger and consists of over 60 villages with no access roads. The lack of access roads have hindered the project implementation and timely service delivery of training, etc. 

furthermore, the strengthened logistical capacity of JDPC shall support the key aspect of project implementation, which is Budget tracking and monitoring. It is anticipated that the advocacy initiatives for good governance will be facilitated by adequate logistical provisions. The project is designed to support JDPC to acquire reasonable logistics (vehicle) capacity. It will be done through counter-part funding from both CAFOD and the local JDPC. All these support would be channeled through CCFN as the National JDPC in Nigeria.</narrative>
  </description>
